LAYOUT = "\n\nPAIRED PRODUCER REPRESENTATION\nReturn exactly scores and paired_scores as required by this request schema. Scores contains only the unpaired dimensions. For each canonical field named under paired_scores, generate its score and presence together in that field's object; do not also emit that dimension under scores or emit a separate content_presence object. All 274 vector dimensions are still assessed exactly once, with their unchanged definitions and rubrics. The 15 paired objects include the corresponding occurrence judgments.\nEach pair must select a valid schema branch: absent allows score zero or null; present and unknown allow any permitted numeric score or null. Present with zero centrality is valid. Unknown occurrence is not automatically a null score, and a null score is not automatically absence. Reassess the concept honestly; do not force either member just to make the pair complete. The controller losslessly restores the existing canonical score and presence keys. No predicted value is changed during decoding.\n"
NONNARRATIVE = '\n\nNONNARRATIVE AND FORMAT APPLICABILITY\nAll selected vector dimensions apply to the requested work. Documentary, experimental or nonnarrative form does not by itself make a narrative device or function not applicable. When you know that a device or function is absent, assess it as zero under its existing rubric. Do not infer absence of depicted subjects, actions or other traits from format labels or synopsis silence. Preserve null only where your knowledge is genuinely insufficient to assess that dimension. This clarification does not require inventing a narrative, forcing scores, or converting unknowns to zero.\n'
SUFFIX = "\n\nPRODUCER ADVISORY REPRESENTATION\nUse the requested schema branches to generate each advisory's presence and details together under the unchanged definitions. Unknown presence requires null details. Absent requires empty depiction modes and numeric details zero or null. Present requires nonempty depiction modes or null, and frequency 1–10 or null; intensity and explicitness can still be zero. The existing animal_harm_types facet is generated once inside advisories.animal_harm, not in facets.advisory_details: unknown animal harm requires null types, absent requires [], present requires supported nonempty types or null. All other requested facets remain unchanged. The controller restores animal_harm_types to its existing canonical facet path without changing any values. Do not invent details to satisfy a branch.\n"
